<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Web Development Standards Implementation</title>

<style>
body{
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
    background:#f4f4f4;
    margin:20px;
}

h1{
    text-align:center;
    color:#003366;
}

nav{
    background:#007BFF;
    padding:15px;
    text-align:center;
}

nav a{
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    margin:20px;
    font-size:18px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

nav a:hover{
    color:yellow;
}

section{
    background:white;
    margin-top:25px;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:8px;
    box-shadow:0 0 8px gray;
}

video{
    display:block;
    margin:auto;
    border:3px solid black;
}

form{
    width:350px;
    margin:auto;
}

label{
    font-weight:bold;
}

input{
    width:100%;
    padding:10px;
    margin:8px 0;
}

input[type="submit"]{
    background:#007BFF;
    color:white;
    border:none;
    cursor:pointer;
}

input[type="submit"]:hover{
    background:#0056b3;
}

pre{
    background:#eeeeee;
    padding:15px;
    border:1px solid #cccccc;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<h1>Web Development Standards Implementation</h1>

<nav>
    <a href="#">Home</a>
    <a href="#">About</a>
    <a href="#">Services</a>
    <a href="#">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section>

<h2>Promotional Video</h2>

<video width="700" height="400" controls>
    <source src="file:///C:/Users/SRAVANTHI%20KODURU/Downloads/promo.mp4.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    Your browser does not support the HTML5 video tag.
</video>

</section>

<section>

<h2>Registration Form</h2>

<form action="#" method="POST">

<label>Name</label>
<input type="text" name="name" required>

<label>Email</label>
<input type="email" name="email" required>

<label>Password</label>
<input type="password" name="password" required>

<input type="submit" value="Register">

</form>

</section>

<section>

<h2>Correct XML Syntax</h2>

<pre>
&lt;?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?&gt;
&lt;note&gt;
    &lt;to&gt;User&lt;/to&gt;
    &lt;from&gt;Admin&lt;/from&gt;
&lt;/note&gt;
</pre>

</section>

<section>

<h2>Web Communication Protocol</h2>

<p>
This web application uses the <strong>HTTP</strong> protocol.
The registration form sends user data securely using the
<strong>POST</strong> method.
</p>

</section>

</body>
</html>
